{"type":"text","timestamp":1794589614212,"sessionID":"ses_e2a222b13ffegJo45ooHszMORK","part":{"id":"prt_1d5e04d190012rGuxg3RhxuoUu","sessionID":"ses_e2a222b13ffegJo45ooHszMORK","messageID":"msg_1d5e035d8001eV8aRl5E7lpV9w","type":"text","text":"T030 complete. The checkbox in `tasks.md` was left unticked as instructed.\n\n## Files written\n\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/cli-surface/advisor-recommend.md` — five citation replacements, no other changes:\n  - `` `schemas/advisor-tool-schemas.ts:308` `` → the `compiledRoute` field of `AdvisorRecommendationSchema` in `schemas/advisor-tool-schemas.ts`\n  - `` `schemas/advisor-tool-schemas.ts:310` `` → the `command` field of `AdvisorRecommendationSchema` in `schemas/advisor-tool-schemas.ts`\n  - `` `handlers/advisor-recommend.ts:563-565`, `632-634` `` → the two `input.options?.includeCompiledRoute === false` checks in `handlers/advisor-recommend.ts`\n  - `` `schemas/advisor-tool-schemas.ts:287` `` and `` `schemas/advisor-tool-schemas.ts:290` `` → the `options` of `AdvisorRecommendInputSchema` in `schemas/advisor-tool-schemas.ts`\n\nThe citations of `lib/skill-advisor-cli-fallback.ts`, `tools/advisor-recommend.ts` and `skill-advisor-cli-manifest.ts` were left untouched, as the task requires.\n\n## Verify output\n\n```\n--- check 1: stale citations (expect nothing) ---\nexit=1\n--- check 2: AdvisorRecommendationSchema (expect 3) ---\n3\n--- check 3: AdvisorRecommendInputSchema (expect 2) ---\n2\n--- check 4: probe (expect no advisor-tool-schemas.ts / handlers/advisor-recommend.ts lines) ---\nlib/skill-advisor-cli-fallback.ts:238 => includeCompiledRoute: true,\nskill-advisor-cli-manifest.ts:57 => includeCompiledRoute: { type: 'boolean', description: 'Attach compiled\nskill-advisor-cli-manifest.ts:58 => compiledRouteTopOnly: { type: 'boolean', description: 'Attach compiled\ntools/advisor-recommend.ts:23 => includeCompiledRoute: { type: 'boolean', description: 'Attach compiled\ntools/advisor-recommend.ts:24 => compiledRouteTopOnly: { type: 'boolean', description: 'Attach compiled\n```\n\nCheck 1 printed nothing (exit 1 because ripgrep found no match), checks 2 and 3 printed the expected 3 and 2, and the probe printed no `advisor-tool-schemas.ts` and no `handlers/advisor-recommend.ts` line. A scoped `git diff --stat` shows only this file changed: `4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)`.\n\n## Notes\n\n- I confirmed beforehand that the schema fields and both handler checks the new prose names actually exist (`AdvisorRecommendationSchema.compiledRoute`, `AdvisorRecommendationSchema.command`, `AdvisorRecommendInputSchema.options`, and exactly two `input.options?.includeCompiledRoute === false` checks), so the replacement sentence is accurate rather than assumed.\n- Nothing could not be done. No git state was touched, no other file was edited.","time":{"start":1794589609241,"end":1794589614212}}}
